                                      1.0000E+00     FACTOR FOR LONGITUDINAL DISPERSIVITY IN MAX-PERM DIRECTION
                                      1.0000E+00     FACTOR FOR LONGITUDINAL DISPERSIVITY IN MIN-PERM DIRECTION
                                      1.0000E+00     FACTOR FOR TRANSVERSE DISPERSIVITY IN MAX-PERM DIRECTION
